"Export to all kind of formats: PDF, Word/Libreoffice, LaTeX, or even HTML "
"slideshows"
msgstr ""
"Espuarte in ducj i gjenars di formât: PDF, Word/Libreoffice, LaTeX, o ancje "
"presentazions in HTML"

